TEXT -160 472 Left 2 ;En hancement type - is ENabled. Just means its normally OFF.\nThis one is P channel like PNP where N has more electrons and positive voltage\nremoves them. So GND will open it and Positive voltage will increase resistance.\nZero V on signal closes NPN transistor, Gate voltage rizes which closes mosfet.\nThis setup is called "High side driver" in order to be able to block current at the \npositive terminal of the appliance, rather then switching the negative terminal.\nSwitching negative terminal is easy with NChannel mosfet, because the load is on the\npositive side. Putting load on the S terminal would cause NChannel mosfet to not fully open
